          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — holistic, integrative care focused on whole-person education and personalized plans.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1: #f6fbf9;\\n      --bg2: #eef7f3;\\n      --accent: #2b8f77;\\n      --accent-2: #7bdcb3;\\n      --muted: #55606a;\\n      --card: #ffffff;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,20,0.08);\\n      --radius: 14px;\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));margin:0;color:#0b2a23}\\n    /* layered SVG backdrop */\\n    .page-veil{\\n      position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:0.85;\\n      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(43,143,119,0.06) 0 8%, transparent 12%), radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(123,220,179,0.06) 0 12%, transparent 18%);\\n    }\\n    /* subtle band with inline SVG pattern */\\n    .pattern-band{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;display:block;height:100%;width:100%;}\\n    .container{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1100px;margin:48px auto;padding:36px;}\\n    header.site{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 8px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .brand .logo{\\n      width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)\\n    }\\n    nav.main{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav.main a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav.main a[href$=\\\"contact.html\\\"]{background:rgba(43,143,119,0.12);color:var(--accent)}\\n    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:22px}\\n    .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:28px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(123,220,179,0.08),rgba(43,143,119,0.03));}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#073427}\\n    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* story */\\n    .story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 160px;gap:16px;align-items:center}\\n    .story .portrait{width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    .story p{margin:0;color:#254137}\\n    /* framework steps */\\n    .framework{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .step .num{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#1d6b57);color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* contact form */\\n    form.fieldset{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:#103827}\\n    input[type=\\\"text\\\"],input[type=\\\"email\\\"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(6,25,20,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg,white,rgba(255,255,255,0.98));font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .muted-small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* testimonials */\\n    .testimonials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .t{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,42,35,0.02),rgba(11,42,35,0.01));padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:980px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.story{grid-template-columns:1fr}.testimonials{grid-template-columns:1fr}.container{padding:18px;margin:18px}}    \\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"page-veil\\\"></div>\\n  <!-- Embedded decorative SVG pattern; unique to this project -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"pattern-band\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e6fbf3\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f1fff8\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"60\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(12)\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"60\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n        <path d=\\\"M0 30 L30 0 M30 60 L60 30\\\" stroke=\\\"#c9f1df\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n      <filter id=\\\"soft\\\" x=\\\"-20%\\\" y=\\\"-20%\\\" width=\\\"140%\\\" height=\\\"140%\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"26\\\"/></filter>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" filter=\\\"url(#soft)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\" />\\n    <g opacity=\\\"0.14\\\" transform=\\\"translate(60,40)\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"200\\\" fill=\\\"#7bdcb3\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n    <g opacity=\\\"0.12\\\" transform=\\\"translate(520,360)\\\">\\n      <rect x=\\\"-20\\\" y=\\\"-40\\\" width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"420\\\" rx=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"#2b8f77\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header class=\\\"site\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#073427\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"main\\\" aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Care & Services</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Common Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Method</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"layout\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <!-- HERO: contact focused -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card hero\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"hero-heading\\\">\\n          <h1 id=\\\"hero-heading\\\">Get in touch — thoughtful, whole-person guidance</h1>\\n          <p>We prioritize education, personalized planning, and practical next steps. Use this form to ask about assessments, VIP Day planning or to request a consultation with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Call:</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{PHONE}}</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-left:12px\\\" class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Email:</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{EMAIL}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- STORY: practitioner intro -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"story\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#083f33\\\">A note from {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</h3>\\n              <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Personalized integrative care — blended clinical insight and lifestyle-focused tools.</p>\\n              <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">I partner with people to understand patterns — sleep, stress, digestion, and energy — then translate lab-friendly options and lifestyle steps into a practical plan. The aim is improved balance and clarity, not promises of cures.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"portrait\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- FRAMEWORK: intake -> plan -> follow-ups -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#073427\\\">How we typically work</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"framework\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><div><strong>Comprehensive intake</strong><div class=\\\"meta\\\">History, priorities, and optional baseline labs (educational review).</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><div><strong>Customized plan</strong><div class=\\\"meta\\\">Diet, movement, targeted supplements, and practical daily tools.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><div><strong>Follow-up & refinement</strong><div class=\\\"meta\\\">Short-cycle check-ins to track progress and adjust the plan.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">4</div><div><strong>VIP Day option</strong><div class=\\\"meta\\\">An intensive, single-day deep dive for focused people ready to implement fast. See the Offers section for more.</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- OFFERS: VIP Day highlight -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#073427\\\">Signature VIP Day</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">A focused, 3–6 hour collaborative session to map your priorities and leave with a concrete, prioritized plan.</p>\\n            <ul style=\\\"margin:0 8px 0 18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n              <li>Deep intake and prioritized action list</li>\\n              <li>Review of existing labs and targeted testing options (as education)</li>\\n              <li>Personalized strategies for sleep, digestion, and energy</li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#114437;font-size:18px\\\">Fast-track planning</div>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;margin-top:10px\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- PRICING summary -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#073427\\\">Investment & next steps</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">We offer single consultations, packages, and the VIP Day. Detailed rates and payment options are listed on the pricing page.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">View Pricing</a>\\n            <a style=\\\"padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(6,25,20,0.06);background:var(--glass);text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a consult</a>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Insurance varies; we provide documentation to assist claims.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#073427\\\">Client reflections</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"t\\\"><strong>\\\"I finally understood my sleep pattern.\\\"</strong><div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">\\\"A practical plan and small daily shifts helped me feel steadier. The session felt collaborative.\\\" — A.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"t\\\"><strong>\\\"Clear next steps after years of overwhelm.\\\"</strong><div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">\\\"We designed an approach that fit my schedule and budget.\\\" — M.</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Testimonials reflect individual experiences; results vary. This practice focuses on education and individualized support.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- CTA -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#073427\\\">Ready to talk?</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"meta\\\">We can schedule a brief call to determine the best starting point.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#073427\\\">Contact form</h4>\\n          <form class=\\\"fieldset\\\" action=\\\"/submit-contact\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"service\\\">I'm interested in</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"service\\\" name=\\\"service\\\">\\n              <option>Intro consultation</option>\\n              <option>VIP Day</option>\\n              <option>Follow-up</option>\\n              <option>Lab review</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"What would you like help with? (sleep, digestion, energy, stress)\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <label style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\" required /> I consent to being contacted by {{BUSINESS_NAME}} about my inquiry.</label>\\n\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn-primary\\\">Send request</button>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Prefer to call? {{PHONE}} • If urgent, please call directly.</p>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#073427\\\">Office</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Telehealth available</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Hours by appointment. Cancellation policy and preparation details are available on the book page.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#073427\\\">Quick links</h4>\\n          <nav style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our intake & plan</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Common concerns</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Meet the practitioner</a>\\n          </nav>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">We provide educational guidance and individualized plans. No guarantees of specific outcomes.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page and notes for the holistic_medicine site\\n\\nFiles in this bundle:\\n- contact.html — The contact page with hero, practitioner story, framework, offers (VIP Day), pricing summary, testimonials and CTA sections. Includes a contact form and office details. Uses placeholders for business info: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n- Drop contact.html into the site root alongside the other templates (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).\\n- Replace placeholders with real values before publishing.\\n- No external assets or CDNs are required. The decorative SVG pattern is embedded inline in contact.html.\\n\\nNotes on content:\\n- Voice is practical and educational; emphasizes whole-person care and does not promise cures.\\n- VIP Day is highlighted as a service option, consistent with the offerModel (vip_day).\\n- Nav labels vary from other pages (e.g., 'Welcome', 'Care & Services', 'Connect').\\n\\nAccessibility & privacy:\\n- Basic semantic structure and form inputs provided. Ensure server-side handling for the form action and privacy/consent compliance.\\n\\nIf you need alternate variations (a compact contact card, or a multi-step intake form), request an additional variant.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
